<p>Let out a mental cry that shatters the will of your targets within radius 10, dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Cunning 100,<br>spellpower 100">59, 79, 95, 108, 120</acronym> darkness damage and confusing (<acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">20%, 28%, 34%, 40%, 45%</acronym> to act randomly) them for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Cunning 100,<br>spellpower 100">9, 10, 10, 10, 10</acronym> turns.</p><p>The damage will improve with your spellpower and the duration will improve with your Cunning.</p>